{"id":"n58977-1-7","stage":0,"title":"벌써 · 已经","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58977-1-7-1","ko":"난 이제 집에 가 봐야 되겠어.","zh":"我得回家了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"난","meaning":"我","explanation":"난 是 나는 的缩略，表示“我”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"난","audio":"/audio/f123177dde5fa8f48570.mp3"}},{"text":"이제","meaning":"现在","explanation":"이제：现在。","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58621","senseId":"2","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}},{"text":"집에","meaning":"回家","explanation":"집：家；-에 表示去往地点，집에 가다 是“回家”。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"1","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집에","audio":"/audio/a007fc659cc1512ff2b3.mp3"}},{"text":"가","meaning":"回去","explanation":"가다：去；与后面的 봐야 되겠다 合用，委婉地说该回去了。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가","audio":"/audio/64ee5293d31bc58b72d7.mp3"}},{"text":"봐야","meaning":"得……了（委婉）","explanation":"-아/어 보다 原义是试着做；가 봐야 되겠다 在这里是委婉地说“该回去了”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐야","audio":"/audio/3326ab465da6795a458b.mp3"}},{"text":"되겠어.","meaning":"应该、得","explanation":"-아/어야 되다 表示必须、该做；-겠- 表示说话人的决定或推测。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"18","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되겠어","audio":"/audio/8a126b478c20ebd9cde6.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"16ebe2403bccd648","term":"이제","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3","entryId":"58621","definition":"当下的时期。","pronunciation":["이제"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"供人居住的房子；집에 가다 是回家。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着、委婉提出做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"与动词连用表示试着做；가 봐야 되겠다 在这里委婉地表达该走了。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"应该、必须（-아/어야 되다）","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"应该、必须（-아/어야 되다）","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/89c270a10303c5b48444.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n58977-1-7-2","ko":"얼마 놀지도 못했는데 벌써 가려고?","zh":"还没玩多久，就已经要走了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"얼마","meaning":"没多久","explanation":"얼마：多少；与后面的否定表达合用，表示时间还不长。","readings":[{"term":"얼마","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29750","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼마","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3"}},{"text":"놀지도","meaning":"连玩也","explanation":"놀다：玩；-지도 与后面的 못하다 合用，表示还没玩多久。","readings":[{"term":"놀다","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88353","senseId":"1","lemma":"놀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"놀지도","audio":"/audio/1f6e08f19863ff740937.mp3"}},{"text":"못했는데","meaning":"还没能……呢","explanation":"못하다：没能；-었- 表示到现在为止，-는데 在句末交代背景、表达惋惜。","readings":[{"term":"못하다","audio":"/audio/641e1150cc79b5b24a33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26838","senseId":"1","lemma":"못하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못했는데","audio":"/audio/7f10b655df1063348e73.mp3"}},{"text":"벌써","meaning":"已经、这么快","explanation":"벌써：比预想更早地，表达惊讶。","readings":[{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58977","senseId":"1","lemma":"벌써","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}},{"text":"가려고?","meaning":"就要走吗","explanation":"가다：去、离开；-려고? 询问对方是否打算离开。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가려고","audio":"/audio/359189395f3f9e7bb4af.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8e0a4529e0c9d4ed","term":"얼마","zh":"多少、不久（否定句中）","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3","entryId":"29750","definition":"数量或时间有多少；얼마 놀지도 못하다 是“还没玩多久”。","pronunciation":["얼마"]},{"id":"8fc8305f6371680e","term":"놀다","zh":"玩耍，玩乐","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3","entryId":"88353","definition":"玩着游戏等度过有趣、愉快的时光。","pronunciation":["놀ː다"]},{"id":"641e1150cc79b5b2","term":"못하다","zh":"没能","audio":"/audio/641e1150cc79b5b24a33.mp3","entryId":"26838","definition":"表示之前的话所指的行动未能达成或没有做该事的能力。","pronunciation":["모ː타다"]},{"id":"d038c1cb7ee215cb","term":"벌써","zh":"已经、这么快","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3","entryId":"58977","definition":"比预想更早地；这里惊讶对方这么快就走。","pronunciation":["벌써"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ae04a6c2786a485da849.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.26,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=58977","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":28,"sequenceScore":1.2203,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["还没玩多久，就已经要走了？","阿姨，一个橙子多少钱？","我得回家了。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["还没玩多久，就已经要走了？","我得回家了。","阿姨，一个橙子多少钱？"],"answer":0}]}
